    {
      "uid": "zhcn:654641a0e25933b5bc17854a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进而让大家明白每天一点一滴地累积，\n就是通往happy的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "382892c95bc56bbdf7acd8b56b01b0619ba74b9450768e7f93f5a7c813d1dd92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
