    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0ec2395474d365aebb4cb10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──梦想。我曾经在心里的某处，\n觉得那必须是非常远大的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2642af416df6f8743a954bdb05661c3e9f5cbdee3a2b75c92bde1e290f07d026",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b4a2fa100f901997f6e353",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但小林历奇的梦想不一样。\n她希望能变得比昨天幸福一点，\n并且希望能持续实现这样的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bbcb2697f897894e22233c518a9b81253b8d79ccada5a29ccbc4189309dbb03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc4cab7ae037edb66ce6d716",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那便是风水的思维，正是与自然融为一体，\n建立“量力而为的未来”的方式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c19ddba183e5f3dc48a79396971510dd602a1f426074bcdeed75150a262452",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d07e1ae80cfe26430a601e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没事，我只是觉得你的想法很棒",
      "source_fingerprint": "628776a4f51197e748a253dc1ad993b3c9830b9eee46fd440160ee8911e4f5d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098111.json",
